廷设赏招回陷于敌境的军民", "description": "景泰元年二月癸未，朝廷公布赏格，招回被困在敌方的军民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年二月癸未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "f07bf63b-aa4a-5187-848e-67ae6085ebcb"}, {"title": "石亨任镇朔大将军，率部巡视大同", "description": "景泰元年二月丙戌，明廷任命石亨为镇朔大将军，令他率部巡视大同。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年二月丙戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ea7d5a2c-7102-5510-9ec5-169e80640591"}, {"title": "杨能任游击将军，巡视宣府", "description": "景泰元年二月，明廷任命都指挥同知杨能为游击将军，令他巡视宣府。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年二月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "a4227e1a-4e30-533a-9e79-37ff88043d3f"}, {"title": "明廷处死太监喜宁", "description": "景泰元年二月壬辰，明廷处死太监喜宁。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年二月壬辰", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "28c590a1-bcc7-5dfd-8f8e-0bc50148eff7"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻朔州", "description": "景泰元年三月己酉，瓦剌军进攻朔州。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年三月己酉", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ce53da71-c55b-5095-ae91-814a762386ad"}, {"title": "明廷下令录用土木之变遇难官员的后人", "description": "景泰元年三月辛亥，朝廷下令录用在土木之变中遇难官员的后人。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年三月辛亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "c0533bce-809b-5421-9735-12768f6a5b94"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻宁夏和庆阳", "description": "景泰元年三月癸丑，瓦剌军进攻宁夏和庆阳。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年三月癸丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "63be6c01-cf19-51d6-a2d4-68e7358beead"}, {"title": "瓦剌军再次进攻朔州", "description": "景泰元年三月乙卯，瓦剌军再次进攻朔州。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年三月乙卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "0885d91b-6e69-5427-87b8-031de92e5479"}, {"title": "明廷免除京畿积欠赋税与夏税", "description": "景泰元年三月癸亥，朝廷免除京畿地区积欠的赋税以及应缴的夏税。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年三月癸亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "c6be85d4-8dc6-5d4f-b81d-7b487de0644d"}, {"title": "广东都指挥李昇、何贵在海上平乱时战死", "description": "景泰元年四月丙子，广东都指挥李昇、何贵率兵捕捉海上盗匪，在交战中阵亡。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月丙子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ab40b3de-bfbf-5542-a004-8a009e59a570"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻大同，被明军击退", "description": "景泰元年四月辛巳，瓦剌军进攻大同，守城的明军将其击退。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月辛巳", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "bcdac75b-8c43-5a1e-94c9-973f83de4f1b"}, {"title": "梁珤接替王骥征讨贵州起事苗民", "description": "景泰元年四月丁亥，朝廷派保定伯梁珤接替王骥，率军征讨贵州起事的苗民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月丁亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3153a77f-a22b-55d1-8367-5a700b44f98e"}, {"title": "李茂赴南京复核囚案、考察官员和军民生活", "description": "景泰元年四月戊子，朝廷令大理寺丞李茂到南京复核囚案，考察各衙门官吏并黜免失职者，调查军民面临的问题。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月戊子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "32238fa2-2d4e-52d8-b245-208494c09fb0"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻雁门", "description": "景泰元年四月丙申，瓦剌军进攻雁门。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月丙申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "2f376e98-5556-5494-8f3a-cf716fe50ad4"}, {"title": "刘安奉命在保定等地练兵，曹泰参赞军务", "description": "景泰元年四月己亥，明廷任命都督同知刘安为总兵官，令他在保定、真定以及涿州、易州、通州练兵，任命佥都御史曹泰参赞军务。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月己亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "15a2471a-e842-5ae6-a004-62b9e223d390"}, {"title": "明廷赈济山东饥民", "description": "景泰元年四月庚子，朝廷赈济山东的饥民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月庚子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "75ace890-1034-5857-8f21-7f6c216fda99"}, {"title": "明廷赈济京畿受侵扰的州县", "description": "景泰元年四月辛丑，朝廷赈济京畿遭受敌军侵扰的州县。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月辛丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "1e43a6f7-54cc-5280-ace0-b3d145104bde"}, {"title": "瓦剌再次进攻大同，被郭登击退", "description": "景泰元年四月癸卯，瓦剌军再次进攻大同，郭登率部将其击退。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年四月癸卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "1dd1a930-3a2f-5d55-b3c4-362f7cab29d9"}, {"title": "明廷豁免山西灾区税粮", "description": "景泰元年五月乙巳，朝廷免除山西受灾地区应缴的税粮。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月乙巳", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "61f3698a-87f2-5d2d-949d-51994c4c413c"}, {"title": "瓦剌军劫掠河曲、代州，明廷派刘安领兵抵御", "description": "景泰元年五月，瓦剌军劫掠河曲和代州，继续向南进攻。朝廷下诏，命刘安率涿州、易州的部队抵御。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "057573ff-09d3-57cf-9c2b-755255e51c96"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻雁门，明廷增兵黄花镇保护皇陵", "description": "景泰元年五月戊申，瓦剌军进攻雁门。明廷增派兵力驻守黄花镇，保卫皇陵。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月戊申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "7f6d562c-af3a-5b01-b905-f6ec0a4abbd9"}, {"title": "董兴击败广东起事者，黄萧养身亡", "description": "景泰元年五月癸丑，本纪记董兴击败广东的起事者，黄萧养身亡。《董兴传》记黄萧养在交战中中箭而死。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月癸丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "283066b4-f908-5afc-ad28-c93f8abc7fa6"}, {"title": "明廷赈济大同受侵扰的军民", "description": "景泰元年五月壬戌，朝廷赈济大同遭受敌军侵扰的军民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月壬戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "fe2e5277-7d09-56f0-9d8d-e1f579241f65"}, {"title": "侯璡、田礼在贵州击败起事苗民", "description": "景泰元年五月丙寅，侍郎侯璡与副总兵田礼在贵州击败起事的苗民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月丙寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "f9c6dc2b-4add-5a7b-bbdb-f9f5ffff5bec"}, {"title": "瓦剌派使者向明廷请求议和", "description": "景泰元年五月辛未，瓦剌派使者向明廷请求议和。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年五月辛未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "47300d2a-fdac-5102-9390-5e2a65cb9009"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻大同，被郭登击退", "description": "景泰元年六月壬午，瓦剌军进攻大同，郭登率部抵御并击退来军。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月壬午", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "e44b163a-eb3d-582b-b567-2fbd8e733af7"}, {"title": "也先再次带太上皇朱祁镇来到大同", "description": "景泰元年六月丙戌，瓦剌太师也先再次带着被俘的太上皇朱祁镇来到大同。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月丙戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "305b63a6-f08a-58b0-808b-15a55e087f77"}, {"title": "陈镒、王文因审理金英家人案获罪下狱，随后获释", "description": "景泰元年六月丁亥，陈镒、王文因被指审问太监金英家人时失实而下狱，随后获释。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月丁亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "31842877-d20b-5f72-9af3-f45038d022e0"}, {"title": "瓦剌军进攻宣府，被朱谦和纪广击退", "description": "景泰元年六月戊子，瓦剌军进攻宣府，都督朱谦、参将纪广率明军将其击退。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月戊子", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "32d5a894-4a85-53ed-9cbe-bf83cfe34192"}, {"title": "明廷豁免山东灾区税粮", "description": "景泰元年六月戊戌，朝廷免除山东受灾州县应缴的税粮。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月戊戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "12039d3e-8bcf-56d3-bdac-d2732a4cf6b1"}, {"title": "明廷派李实和罗绮出使瓦剌", "description": "景泰元年六月己亥，明廷派给事中李实、大理寺丞罗绮出使瓦剌。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年六月己亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "759cd4d0-d7c3-58aa-8818-0d1f40c458d2"}, {"title": "侯璡、方瑛在贵州获胜，将被俘首领送京", "description": "景泰元年七月庚戌条记，尚书侯璡、参将方瑛在贵州击败起事的苗民，俘获其首领并送往京师。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年七月庚戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "b564e50f-54e0-5b6b-8b3b-6af66210158b"}, {"title": "明廷派杨善和赵荣出使瓦剌", "description": "景泰元年七月庚申，明廷派右都御史杨善、工部侍郎赵荣出使瓦剌。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年七月庚申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9ad96465-0a00-55a3-8ded-fe13486a230a"}, {"title": "明廷停止要求山西百姓运粮到大同", "description": "景泰元年七月，朝廷停止由山西百姓向大同运送粮食。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年七月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "bb6091e7-146e-58bf-8238-02c25f7c7972"}, {"title": "李实、罗绮从瓦剌返回", "description": "景泰元年七月癸亥，出使瓦剌的李实、罗绮返回。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年七月癸亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "3d85fb80-afda-5347-bbd5-7f2ff76a9295"}, {"title": "杨善抵达瓦剌，也先同意让明英宗回国", "description": "景泰元年七月己巳，杨善抵达瓦剌太师也先处。也先同意让太上皇朱祁镇返回明朝。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年七月己巳", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9fe57251-7df8-5e28-80fc-0d6b77c0bd4a"}, {"title": "太上皇朱祁镇从瓦剌启程返回明朝", "description": "景泰元年八月癸酉，太上皇朱祁镇离开瓦剌，启程返回明朝。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年八月癸酉", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "81a8aa77-f624-59f8-b533-7dc8ead2b82a"}, {"title": "明景帝祭祀社稷", "description": "景泰元年八月戊寅，明景帝朱祁钰祭祀社稷。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年八月戊寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "51d62a51-4edf-5e33-84f0-8b2d84139a79"}, {"title": "明廷派商辂到居庸关迎接太上皇", "description": "景泰元年八月甲申，朝廷派侍读商辂前往居庸关，迎接由瓦剌回来的太上皇朱祁镇。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年八月甲申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "ed48ff18-9442-598e-9db3-dcddfda15729"}, {"title": "太上皇朱祁镇回到京师，入住南宫", "description": "景泰元年八月丙戌，太上皇朱祁镇回到京师。景帝在东安门迎接，朱祁镇随后入住南宫，景帝率百官拜见。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年八月丙戌", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "bb583753-8180-50c9-858c-54cf48955364"}, {"title": "明廷大赦天下", "description": "景泰元年八月庚寅，明廷下令大赦天下。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年八月庚寅", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "710d4fb6-ad49-592e-81b1-5975776d1c8f"}, {"title": "江渊以刑部侍郎兼翰林学士身份入阁", "description": "景泰元年（1450年）八月，江渊以刑部侍郎兼翰林学士身份入阁。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年（1450年）八月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "7abfa27a-f340-51ec-9b51-21defc177637"}, {"title": "王来受命总督湖广、贵州军务", "description": "景泰元年九月癸丑，明廷命巡抚河南的副都御史王来总督湖广、贵州军务，征讨起事的苗民。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年九月癸丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9e18fcdf-9d6e-560a-b6e0-f7cee1d71e18"}, {"title": "明廷复核在押人员案件", "description": "景泰元年十月辛卯，明廷复核在押人员的案件。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年十月辛卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "b4e30287-62d0-56c4-98d7-9104c2eaf020"}, {"title": "明廷免除京畿积欠赋税", "description": "景泰元年十月癸巳，朝廷免除京畿积欠的赋税。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年十月癸巳", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "0f051280-eaf5-57f3-ab66-7eff1b2be63f"}, {"title": "胡濙请求让百官为太上皇祝寿", "description": "景泰元年十一月辛亥，礼部尚书胡濙请求让百官向太上皇祝寿。本纪下文记景帝没有同意。", "start_year": 1450, "end_year": 1450, "time_original": "景泰元年十一月辛亥", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "2bc465a0-af39-5978-833b-d7714245e37e"}, {"title": "胡濙请求次年正月初一让百官朝见太上皇", "description": "景泰元年十二月丙申，礼部尚书胡濙再次进言，请求次年正月初一让百官在延安门朝见太上皇。景帝没有批准。", "start_year": 1451, "end_year": 1451, "time_original": "景泰元年十二月丙申", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "0b6a7c6a-46eb-56d2-b8ab-85678ee74672"}, {"title": "朝鲜在景泰元年三次进贡马匹", "description": "据本纪年末汇记，景泰元年朝鲜有三次进贡马匹。 按原历纪年，事情发生在公元1450至1451年之间。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "景泰元年", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "2c46cda0-2da5-558c-9e2d-49b6c0d98390"}]'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

